\begin{problem}
A standard deck of cards has 52 cards (4 suits of 13 kinds each).
In 5-card poker, two pairs is 2 of one kind of card, 2 of another kind, and
1 of a third kind (so that it doesn't become a full house).
(e.g.
$5\heartsuit$,
$5\clubsuit$,
$8\diamondsuit$,
$8\spadesuit$,
$2\spadesuit$)
What is the probability of being dealt 2 pairs?
\end{problem}
